      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/{size}/2018_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-10-24T18:39:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you load up the game instructions (\"How to play\" from the main menu), the details about how the new \"Repeating Decisions\" function works are at the end of the \"Gameplay\" section, just before \"Cards\"</p>\n<p>What's useful to know is that any repeating decisions are tracked in the active effects panel, so you can turn them off if you don't want them anymore.</p>",
